{"version":1,"content":"<p>賭王千金何超蓮日前出席時尚活動，為配合大會「黃金時代」的主題，她特意借來從80年代珍藏至今的裙子，非常有意義。</p><p>穿上吊帶低胸裙的超蓮大晒豐滿上圍，加上黑色手套及花朵裝飾，高貴又優雅，完美展現其千金氣質。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:21:14.732493+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T16:01:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:19.957636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:19.957636+00:00","content_hash":"724876031a44247258c27a5c19c5ef3e43933aa670d01b5a92e75176cb46ac8b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}